{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:0/0c/0q5ne8g1zc94ge1gh7xsi4xjgok8rw3.mp3","text":"博士？不，我没有打盹！只是......只是在愣神！","alt":"voice_cn/char_440_pinecn/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:6/69/j7yyq1xp3k53xaevclpxsngd76km9ab.mp3","text":"外面下雨了吗？以前我可讨厌下雨天了......地上都是泥，还会影响施工，爸爸就要到很晚才会回来。不过雨后的天气都很舒适，像现在这样待在房间里的话，也挺不错的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_440_pinecn/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/75/nlqli1dx8ua50hhat5aafdpj8kdzu0h.mp3","text":"在哥伦比亚当工人的时候，日子过得可辛苦了，每天早上都要起得很早，晚上要睡得很晚，有时候稍微加个班，回过神来就发现自己没空睡觉啦......","alt":"voice_cn/char_440_pinecn/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/38/kle0xjlritlox0w266nqf8my1qwsg7u.mp3","text":"啊，博士，要不要一起随便去哪儿逛逛？嗯？啊......！我、我的工具包呢......难道又被我忘在施工现场了？抱、抱歉，我去去就回！","alt":"voice_cn/char_440_pinecn/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:3/33/edzfge2o6hjlwv0f4j4p8xq5a06nmn3.mp3","text":"想做的事情啊......有份稳定的工作，踏踏实实过日子就行了呗。那何必要成为干员？啊......因为这样薪水高一点，想了想好像也可以......没差吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_440_pinecn/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/a7/6dbbc9uvutvaw8c76nfly71w52xyb8k.mp3","text":"感染者......在哥伦比亚，感染者工人也有不少......大家都说要远离他们，不过看他们做活的模样，也没什么差别嘛。","alt":"voice_cn/char_440_pinecn/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a1/fz1llrzirlew8u4ly09acwa9a6pl231.mp3","text":"啊......我忘记了可露希尔小姐交代的工作是什么了......是什么呢.....回去问的话肯定会挨骂吧......不如，博士？你帮帮我呗......？","alt":"voice_cn/char_440_pinecn/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/db/p3bvb24g0w0acol6rl31q4yg70ouiwg.mp3","text":"爸爸以前也总是说，我们要多多学习才能有更好的生活，博士，你懂的很多对吧？能不能教教我？我尽量不犯迷糊，呃，尽量。","alt":"voice_cn/char_440_pinecn/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/42/5hczl0uqbvr4onpib0h6k9kigcqo2mi.mp3","text":"我以前从来没想过未来的事，反正就是在拓荒队里随便找份闲工，和工匠活打一辈子交道呗。不过现在......哎，我很感谢大个子，让我遇到了博士......呃，那、那个，就是很感谢他！","alt":"voice_cn/char_440_pinecn/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:2/27/pv8s63kl4m4hh13zihfhi5bjy1wcex6.mp3","text":"唔啊......好困......干脆和博士一起打个盹吧......","alt":"voice_cn/char_440_pinecn/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:4/47/3ymh679322sijguje7mvwrx727bybuc.mp3","text":"代号松果.....今天开始为罗德岛工作，唔......请问您看见我的便携蓄电池了吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_440_pinecn/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:5/56/f183zzebpu0052hpo8u1b3nptt20r4z.mp3","text":"唔，唔，唔......完全不明白啊......","alt":"voice_cn/char_440_pinecn/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c5/itmo2i915bmrgf4im57w5g9c242ltzs.mp3","text":"谢谢您，博士......但是之后我要怎么做？啊......是不是学着其他前辈的样子就好了？好嘞......！","alt":"voice_cn/char_440_pinecn/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9f/4du91xdhstpfwe9pmeruy2qrjinwvb4.mp3","text":"唔......？又是晋升，哈哈，博士你也会犯迷糊呀，你上次不是和我说过——不一样？唔，好吧，要干啥都听博士的，咱们什么时候出发？","alt":"voice_cn/char_440_pinecn/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c4/gamzmzazc2x9k5l7epm0yhx4xhyfwh9.mp3","text":"轮到我啦。","alt":"voice_cn/char_440_pinecn/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b6/1h6hz4jblwmitximrlirk5fvs3kaqzm.mp3","text":"和施工队长差不多意思呗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_440_pinecn/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7b/83w23281ecc009yjo493syu4tkkeh2y.mp3","text":"那个......目的地在哪儿来着......","alt":"voice_cn/char_440_pinecn/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ee/7jkla0el0fotc1ewdl1xdgkmnivwngk.mp3","text":"是敌人，不要手下留情！","alt":"voice_cn/char_440_pinecn/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d8/fil8nvy0in1cheho19cfndo2nnqwk7r.mp3","text":"唔，我在认真听！","alt":"voice_cn/char_440_pinecn/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b0/i122pfxlsg26ow9pys0vde38835ebcq.mp3","text":"您说吧，博士！","alt":"voice_cn/char_440_pinecn/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:9/95/lhppaeb1q2c9dpf35yb5eta123d1b8n.mp3","text":"就在这儿？","alt":"voice_cn/char_440_pinecn/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:7/74/9mw75u4ayf8g1tu7nwih999gxovy2sk.mp3","text":"我会像钉子一样钉在这里。","alt":"voice_cn/char_440_pinecn/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:5/58/l5bmmliftvqf0amstawaycndqumw88a.mp3","text":"嘿呀！","alt":"voice_cn/char_440_pinecn/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:2/26/b19iwk51amf2mlzxcrr6j3hlgbtengw.mp3","text":"电量储备还很充足！","alt":"voice_cn/char_440_pinecn/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/dd/69m57520jtbr51063bo42qmd3y4kxzz.mp3","text":"扣动扳机！","alt":"voice_cn/char_440_pinecn/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d7/px2d78sply1solgmdtaormcx4o6x3cg.mp3","text":"就像平时打钉那样！","alt":"voice_cn/char_440_pinecn/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:8/87/t32ogss2dsd4m50ria6qonqk4pdqc3t.mp3","text":"呜啊，这可比造一栋房子困难多了，博士，咱们是不是有点了不起啊？","alt":"voice_cn/char_440_pinecn/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a5/o2sjlm01q3ni98ifkgmj3n4jirhjn54.mp3","text":"完美收工......博士，您还满意吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_440_pinecn/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:7/72/o0stbb2qoxof91jdgusiuo3sje2k99b.mp3","text":"唔，是操作流程有问题吗......对不起，没能好好完成任务......","alt":"voice_cn/char_440_pinecn/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9c/fu9oxtdwc0cufeazlpgl56i5nthgv62.mp3","text":"欸，怎么开始冒火花了......抱、抱歉，都怪我......","alt":"voice_cn/char_440_pinecn/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e4/2ghejd7qf9hr6ec0y7d8yuw2ytgx76m.mp3","text":"唔，有哪里需要维护一下吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_440_pinecn/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:1/16/99kj3j25xwa58g79pjmvjovkaq8ogzn.mp3","text":"啊......！","alt":"voice_cn/char_440_pinecn/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:9/91/m6xoj2gplh8je60t50usj9qsia3ldrf.mp3","text":"博士，要不要一起来看雨？虽然没什么好看的......","alt":"voice_cn/char_440_pinecn/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:7/71/bpuj1a6c1hdjal9tu3yx5dj889yd2tt.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_440_pinecn/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:4/46/5i1is1344yo4h4i0jeh2dd1bfmyo1sk.mp3","text":"啊，因为是新年，所以我把博士的办公室翻新了一下......嗯，就是处理了一些磨损痕迹，重做了墙面装饰。呃，您、您不喜欢的话，这个拆除也很容易的......","alt":"voice_cn/char_440_pinecn/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d4/2luqjbrxbuc112vmmt5chsowo18q4ya.mp3","text":"您好，博士。","alt":"voice_cn/char_440_pinecn/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:9/98/ggvz1s1uy1h3jwiy9xb081jwgsz3ha6.mp3","text":"博士？不，我没有打盹！只是......只是在愣神！","alt":"voice/char_440_pinecn/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a1/fcjtrtr8d4qtt1jr21yropql2mrzk9i.mp3","text":"外面下雨了吗？以前我可讨厌下雨天了......地上都是泥，还会影响施工，爸爸就要到很晚才会回来。不过雨后的天气都很舒适，像现在这样待在房间里的话，也挺不错的。","alt":"voice/char_440_pinecn/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/46/564gibrprmjqi4l5vf925mr4zugwlro.mp3","text":"在哥伦比亚当工人的时候，日子过得可辛苦了，每天早上都要起得很早，晚上要睡得很晚，有时候稍微加个班，回过神来就发现自己没空睡觉啦......","alt":"voice/char_440_pinecn/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/e7/rgvopbw4hoy0ggq1zsvjcqguaabajnl.mp3","text":"啊，博士，要不要一起随便去哪儿逛逛？嗯？啊......！我、我的工具包呢......难道又被我忘在施工现场了？抱、抱歉，我去去就回！","alt":"voice/char_440_pinecn/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1c/39dxrywmt087rqzblv14bdulij499sr.mp3","text":"想做的事情啊......有份稳定的工作，踏踏实实过日子就行了呗。那何必要成为干员？啊......因为这样薪水高一点，想了想好像也可以......没差吧。","alt":"voice/char_440_pinecn/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/6f/m2ago1adicm6gnd3z0rburraowvow4e.mp3","text":"感染者......在哥伦比亚，感染者工人也有不少......大家都说要远离他们，不过看他们做活的模样，也没什么差别嘛。","alt":"voice/char_440_pinecn/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:5/52/p6ohl3zlmxam25fwmtw90m6xlvmcvfn.mp3","text":"啊......我忘记了可露希尔小姐交代的工作是什么了......是什么呢.....回去问的话肯定会挨骂吧......不如，博士？你帮帮我呗......？","alt":"voice/char_440_pinecn/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/a4/oz5nwak6c2vw0gdhoxcryj9wgjfr1q0.mp3","text":"爸爸以前也总是说，我们要多多学习才能有更好的生活，博士，你懂的很多对吧？能不能教教我？我尽量不犯迷糊，呃，尽量。","alt":"voice/char_440_pinecn/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/57/e2pcj99b0coyonxjy0sbihtgp2u1i1t.mp3","text":"我以前从来没想过未来的事，反正就是在拓荒队里随便找份闲工，和工匠活打一辈子交道呗。不过现在......哎，我很感谢大个子，让我遇到了博士......呃，那、那个，就是很感谢他！","alt":"voice/char_440_pinecn/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:4/41/6rg2ljvc79muieowrft8i4x4tn0xu90.mp3","text":"唔啊......好困......干脆和博士一起打个盹吧......","alt":"voice/char_440_pinecn/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2e/k048qh28ink2dki6d9j7bty42m7sgny.mp3","text":"代号松果.....今天开始为罗德岛工作，唔......请问您看见我的便携蓄电池了吗？","alt":"voice/char_440_pinecn/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:5/54/4vt0dgp9v5uzp560cj7xh8si8n6k8dh.mp3","text":"唔，唔，唔......完全不明白啊......","alt":"voice/char_440_pinecn/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3e/okaocqm8s5hvgi76rkiprrm9ws4fc42.mp3","text":"谢谢您，博士......但是之后我要怎么做？啊......是不是学着其他前辈的样子就好了？好嘞......！","alt":"voice/char_440_pinecn/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d3/huse0t53700pp6y1k2kwx44wgotiuyv.mp3","text":"唔......？又是晋升，哈哈，博士你也会犯迷糊呀，你上次不是和我说过——不一样？唔，好吧，要干啥都听博士的，咱们什么时候出发？","alt":"voice/char_440_pinecn/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f4/le01coajkhut3giwixp7w0grcepqw1n.mp3","text":"轮到我啦。","alt":"voice/char_440_pinecn/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1b/mq6hl0ter1p8qw1fg844i8odzgb39yv.mp3","text":"和施工队长差不多意思呗？","alt":"voice/char_440_pinecn/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:0/07/4dxhbcewbqgqxr11molgq9zjfqzqwq4.mp3","text":"那个......目的地在哪儿来着......","alt":"voice/char_440_pinecn/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:0/01/iz91mmek7b5xa3z1norvpt2snqtjmwd.mp3","text":"是敌人，不要手下留情！","alt":"voice/char_440_pinecn/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a7/o1qzxrsao8u2y871ol791tlvxwhnl4u.mp3","text":"唔，我在认真听！","alt":"voice/char_440_pinecn/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/3b/mohewoi27zyp0ctlzr63usovlsle7l9.mp3","text":"您说吧，博士！","alt":"voice/char_440_pinecn/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d7/rex0fniitb19by9wjjibkzz0i0eg299.mp3","text":"就在这儿？","alt":"voice/char_440_pinecn/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:a/aa/bat8de72ml91cnf7qfz4nznhpfg03vm.mp3","text":"我会像钉子一样钉在这里。","alt":"voice/char_440_pinecn/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ef/pevdwwbmihp96spb19d9cyaeguj3848.mp3","text":"嘿呀！","alt":"voice/char_440_pinecn/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c6/19mqqnq94epm4nku8uk4zh58868l0z6.mp3","text":"电量储备还很充足！","alt":"voice/char_440_pinecn/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/bb/gh3ej4pssphog1efa23v56fh3ynhwfg.mp3","text":"扣动扳机！","alt":"voice/char_440_pinecn/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:9/95/p2zpe16dzpjfq855gvgd07l5isml1wg.mp3","text":"就像平时打钉那样！","alt":"voice/char_440_pinecn/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9f/2s05jljlxt09q8ex0r5jjcci69ehjsc.mp3","text":"呜啊，这可比造一栋房子困难多了，博士，咱们是不是有点了不起啊？","alt":"voice/char_440_pinecn/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:8/82/pqppizb253ok12ym7dalytl4y2atiuo.mp3","text":"完美收工......博士，您还满意吗？","alt":"voice/char_440_pinecn/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:c/cc/5suc40ityst673lhmopskscp8prv2re.mp3","text":"唔，是操作流程有问题吗......对不起，没能好好完成任务......","alt":"voice/char_440_pinecn/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:1/19/o32f38j1kejqdhw7ci7qjofn7dcx2ea.mp3","text":"欸，怎么开始冒火花了......抱、抱歉，都怪我......","alt":"voice/char_440_pinecn/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:4/48/pzkbbyvctfeadrj9bglmcgpzmyh84r8.mp3","text":"唔，有哪里需要维护一下吗？","alt":"voice/char_440_pinecn/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fd/gc7ju750akzx1vjwd6e5vut7zkuh